---
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<!-- heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg" -->
<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
  pubDate={new Date("August 08 2021")}
>
  <p>
    Hiya 👋🏼 I'm Juan. I'm an artist, designer and engineer* based out of London.
    I'm currently living in Seoul (in 2025). I like making things. These days I
    make jewellery and small objects, inspired by the built environment or
    reflecting on the materials that surround us.
  </p>

  <p>
    In addition to my studio work, I run a jewellery brand called Minilith (<a
      href="http://minilith.co.uk"
      class="underline!">minilith.co.uk</a
    >), making silver jewellery inspired by modernist architecture. Minilith is
    part of Makerversity, a community of designers, craftspeople and inventors.
  </p>

  <p>
    I'm based in Somerset House, central London's historic arts center.<br />You
    can contact me at <span>
      juan<span
        class="inline-block relative before:content-['@'] before:absolute"
        ><span class="inline-block overflow-clip opacity-0 text-[0.65em]"
          >[at]</span
        >castrovaron.com
      </span>
    </span>
  </p>

  <hr />

  <p>
    <ul>
      <li>Born 1997</li>
      <li>Colombia</li>
    </ul>
  </p>
  <p>
    <h4 class="tgbe-font text-[1rem]!">Education & Residencies:</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2023-2025</span> Under-30 Resident @
        Somerset House, London
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024-2025</span> K2 Academy of Contemporary
        Jewellery, London
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2022-2023</span> Craft courses at Central
        Saint Martins & Others
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2014-2018</span> Universidad de los
        Andes, Bogotá, Colombia
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block"></span>
        <span class="text-gray-400"
          >Computer Science* minor in Graphic Design</span
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
  <p>
    <h4 class="tgbe-font text-[1rem]!">Work in Public Collections:</h4>
