      <li>
        <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024</span> Goldsmith's Craft & Design
        Awards - Gold Award
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
  <p>
    <h4 class="tgbe-font text-[1rem]!">Group Exhibitions:</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>
